    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-207",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "魏師退，稷還荊州，就拜黃門侍郎，復爲司馬、新興、永寧二郡太守。",
      "reading": "魏退後還荊州，官黃門侍郎等。",
      "note": "魏退後還荊州，官黃門侍郎等。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 207,
      "end_codepoint": 238,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-238",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "郡犯私諱，改永寧爲長寧。",
      "reading": "因私諱改永寧為長寧；傳首父永。",
      "note": "因私諱改永寧為長寧；傳首父永。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 238,
      "end_codepoint": 250,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-250",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "尋遷司徒司馬，加輔國將軍。",
      "reading": "遷司徒司馬，加輔國。",
      "note": "遷司徒司馬，加輔國。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 250,
      "end_codepoint": 263,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-263",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "及江州刺史陳顯達舉兵反，以本號鎮歷陽、南譙二郡太守，遷鎮南長史、尋陽太守、輔國將軍、行江州事。",
      "reading": "陳顯達起兵，稷出鎮，行江州事。",
      "note": "陳顯達起兵，稷出鎮，行江州事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 263,
      "end_codepoint": 310,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-310",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "尋徵還，爲持節、輔國將軍、都督北徐州諸軍事、北徐州刺史。",
      "reading": "徵還後持節督北徐，刺北徐。",
      "note": "徵還後持節督北徐，刺北徐。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 310,
      "end_codepoint": 338,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-338",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "出次白下，仍遷都督南兗州諸軍事、南兗州刺史。",
      "reading": "至白下，改督、刺南兗。",
      "note": "至白下，改督、刺南兗。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 338,
      "end_codepoint": 360,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-360",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "俄進督北徐、徐、兗、青、冀五州諸軍事，將軍並如故。",
      "reading": "進督五州，將軍號仍舊。",
      "note": "進督五州，將軍號仍舊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 360,
      "end_codepoint": 385,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-385",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "永元末，徵爲侍中，宿衛宮城。",
      "reading": "永元末為侍中，宿衛宮城。",
      "note": "永元末為侍中，宿衛宮城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 385,
      "end_codepoint": 399,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-399",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "義師至，兼衛尉江淹出奔。",
      "reading": "義師至，兼衛尉江淹出奔。",
      "note": "義師至，兼衛尉江淹出奔。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 399,
      "end_codepoint": 411,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence2-411",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "稷兼衛尉，副王瑩都督城內諸軍事。",
      "reading": "稷兼其職，在王瑩下督城內軍。",
      "note": "稷兼其職，在王瑩下督城內軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 411,
      "end_codepoint": 427,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "時東昏淫虐，義師圍城已久，城內思亡而莫有先發。",
      "reading": "東昏末城被圍，城人欲去而遲疑。",
      "note": "東昏末城被圍，城人欲去而遲疑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 23,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-23",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "北徐州刺史王珍國就稷謀之，乃使直閤張齊害東昏于含德殿。",
      "reading": "王珍國與稷定計，使張齊害東昏於含德殿。",
      "note": "王珍國與稷定計，使張齊害東昏於含德殿。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 23,
      "end_codepoint": 50,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-50",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "稷召尚書右僕射王亮等列坐殿前西鐘下，謂曰：「昔桀有昏德，鼎遷于殷；商紂暴虐，鼎遷于周。",
      "reading": "稷召王亮等於西鐘下，以夏桀商紂為比。",
      "note": "稷召王亮等於西鐘下，以夏桀商紂為比。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 50,
      "end_codepoint": 93,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-93",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "今獨夫自絕于天，四海已歸聖主，斯實微子去殷之時，項伯歸漢之日，可不勉哉！」",
      "reading": "獨夫指東昏，聖主指蕭衍；引微子、項伯勸與坐者。",
      "note": "獨夫指東昏，聖主指蕭衍；引微子、項伯勸與坐者。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 93,
      "end_codepoint": 130,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-130",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "乃遣國子博士范雲、舍人裴長穆等使石頭城詣高祖，高祖以稷爲侍中、左衛將軍。",
      "reading": "遣范雲、裴長穆詣石頭城，蕭衍授稷新職。",
      "note": "遣范雲、裴長穆詣石頭城，蕭衍授稷新職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 130,
      "end_codepoint": 166,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-166",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "高祖總百揆，遷大司馬左司馬。",
      "reading": "高祖總百揆，稷遷大司馬左司馬。",
      "note": "高祖總百揆，稷遷大司馬左司馬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 166,
      "end_codepoint": 180,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-180",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "梁臺建，爲散騎常侍、中書令。",
      "reading": "梁臺成立，出任散騎常侍、中書令。",
      "note": "梁臺成立，出任散騎常侍、中書令。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 180,
      "end_codepoint": 194,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-194",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "高祖受禪，以功封江安縣侯，邑一千戶。",
      "reading": "高祖受禪，封江安縣侯、食邑一千戶。",
      "note": "高祖受禪，封江安縣侯、食邑一千戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 194,
      "end_codepoint": 212,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-212",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "又爲侍中、國子祭酒，領驍騎將軍，遷護軍將軍、揚州大中正，以事免。",
      "reading": "歷祭酒、護軍等後以事免。",
      "note": "歷祭酒、護軍等後以事免。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 212,
      "end_codepoint": 244,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-244",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "尋爲度支尚書、前將軍、太子右衛率，又以公事免。",
      "reading": "再歷度支尚書等，又因公事免。",
      "note": "再歷度支尚書等，又因公事免。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 244,
      "end_codepoint": 267,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-267",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "俄爲祠部尚書，轉散騎常侍、都官尚書、揚州大中正，以本職知領軍事。",
      "reading": "自祠部轉都官等，以本職知領軍。",
      "note": "自祠部轉都官等，以本職知領軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 267,
      "end_codepoint": 299,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence3-299",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "尋遷領軍將軍，中正、侯如故。",
      "reading": "遷領軍將軍，揚州大中正、侯仍舊。",
      "note": "遷領軍將軍，揚州大中正、侯仍舊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 299,
      "end_codepoint": 313,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "時魏寇青州，詔假節、行州事。",
      "reading": "魏寇青州，假節行州事。",
      "note": "魏寇青州，假節行州事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 14,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-14",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "會魏軍退，仍出爲散騎常侍、將軍，吳興太守，秩中二千石。",
      "reading": "魏退，出吳興太守，秩中二千石。",
      "note": "魏退，出吳興太守，秩中二千石。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 14,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "下車存問遺老，引其子孫，置之右職，政稱寬恕。",
      "reading": "問遺老，引其子孫任職；子孫屬遺老。",
      "note": "問遺老，引其子孫任職；子孫屬遺老。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 41,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "進號雲麾將軍，徵尚書左僕射。",
      "reading": "進雲麾，徵尚書左僕射。",
      "note": "進雲麾，徵尚書左僕射。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "輿駕將欲如稷宅，以盛暑，留幸僕射省，舊臨幸供具皆酬太官饌直，帝以稷清貧，手詔不受。",
      "reading": "帝以暑未如其宅，免償太官饌直。",
      "note": "帝以暑未如其宅，免償太官饌直。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 118,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-118",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "出爲使持節、散騎常侍、都督青、冀二州諸軍事、安北將軍、青、冀二州刺史。",
      "reading": "出督青冀，為安北將軍、青冀刺史。",
      "note": "出督青冀，為安北將軍、青冀刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 118,
      "end_codepoint": 153,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-153",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "會魏寇朐山，詔稷權頓六里，都督衆軍。",
      "reading": "魏寇朐山，權頓六里督軍。",
      "note": "魏寇朐山，權頓六里督軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 153,
      "end_codepoint": 171,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence4-171",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "還，進號鎮北將軍。",
      "reading": "還後進鎮北。",
      "note": "還後進鎮北。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 171,
      "end_codepoint": 180,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "初鬱洲接邊陲，民俗多與魏人交市。",
      "reading": "鬱洲近邊，有與魏人交市之俗。",
      "note": "鬱洲近邊，有與魏人交市之俗。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 16,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence5-16",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "及朐山叛，或與魏通，旣不自安矣；且稷寬弛無防，僚吏頗侵漁之。",
      "reading": "朐山叛後部分州民私通魏，州吏侵民。",
      "note": "朐山叛後部分州民私通魏，州吏侵民。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 16,
      "end_codepoint": 46,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence5-46",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "州人徐道角等夜襲州城，害稷，時年六十三。",
      "reading": "徐道角等夜襲州城殺稷，稷卒年六十三。",
      "note": "徐道角等夜襲州城殺稷，稷卒年六十三。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 46,
      "end_codepoint": 66,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence5-66",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "有司奏削爵土。",
      "reading": "有司請削爵土，原段只言奏。",
      "note": "有司請削爵土，原段只言奏。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 66,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds",
      "source_quote": "稷性烈亮，善與人交。",
      "reading": "性烈亮，善交人。",
      "note": "性烈亮，善交人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 10,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-zhangji:received_sentence6-10",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
